{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 401, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f0f081608143f0bbf0aef8dbf24781b82f2ff0b5f268f8f4f3c4f2e0fbc5f1cff8aff1acf0b2f0f0f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "네～，글리신 씨∈//오늘도 컨디션 좋아 보이네요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ハーイ、グリシーヌさーん∈//今日も調子よさそうですね～！", "pointer_offset": 332, "unit": "dialogue:dd7c16a0ae9b5ec5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 458, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b5f0aef0b6f0b7f0d3f144f7d12f2ff1bef1f7f0b681432f2ff0d8f0e2f957f2d7f14ff2bdf168f0b18144", "baseline_text": "오리히메인가…//여전히，//그대는 활기차구나．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "織姫か……//あいかわらず、//そなたは元気だな。", "pointer_offset": 336, "unit": "dialogue:6975d698cf56f83b", "prior_review": "재검수2"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 505, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f0b2f0d4f0aef0aff8e1f2aaf1462f2f8175f693f8f3f173f3448176f7d12f2ff0e3f144f944f266f18ef243f8a4f287f957f299f0b2f29c8148", "baseline_text": "이탈리아의 명문//「붉은 귀족」…//본가가 걱정되지 않는 것이냐？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "イタリアの名門//「赤い貴族」……//本家が心配にならぬのか？", "pointer_offset": 340, "unit": "dialogue:85c5e7870aee741f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 564, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0af81482f2ff1dbf8b6f266f98ef16ff8f3f28a81432f2ff991f0a5f984f154f0cff184f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "하아？//딱히 걱정 같은 건，//안 하고 있다고요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はぁ？//べつに心配なんか、//してないですよ。", "pointer_offset": 344, "unit": "dialogue:4ec7ee07b6d56e59", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 609, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f0dff0e2f8a3f3a5f0a4f8f4f2e4f984f154f18481432f2ff3f0f0adf944f24cf24df0a5f0f181432f2ff0a4fc83f1e2f984f154f0a2f0b8f261f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "제대로 편지도 쓰고 있고，//엄마가 확실하게，//지켜 주고 있으니까요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ちゃんと手紙も書いてますし、//ママがしっかりと、//守ってくれてますからね。", "pointer_offset": 348, "unit": "dialogue:ee13bfc2c199ef40", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 684, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d48143f3892f2ff0d8fa62fae1f1b1f0a2f0bcf957f1c8f26bf0ef81608148", "baseline_text": "하지만，왜//그런 걸 물으시는 거예요～？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも、どうして//そんなこと聞くですか～？", "pointer_offset": 352, "unit": "dialogue:32bfc2afb7d4c2f6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 725, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f2c3f7d12f2ff0e0f38af0b7fa72f144f146f0b22f2ff266f18ef243f94ff0bcf0edf14bf947f263f0b2f1488144", "baseline_text": "음…//블뢰메르 가문이//걱정되기 시작해서 말이야．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うむ……//ブルーメール家のことが//心配になってきてな。", "pointer_offset": 356, "unit": "dialogue:b49058cfbeefa65b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 780, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f174f0aef8e7f1f2f9aef0a48143f28df8adf243f8a4f287f2e9f8c8f2f3f0d3f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "파리를 떠난 지，얼마 되지 않았을 뿐인데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "巴里を離れて、わずかな間しか//たっておらぬというのに……", "pointer_offset": 360, "unit": "dialogue:1cc86a12b717386b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 837, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f2cef2ce81608143f1d2f14af150f0d3f144f0ef81482f2ff0bbf0aef8dbf24781432f2ff173f1bef98cf1c7f8f4f154f0f0f0ef81608144", "baseline_text": "후후～，향수병인가요？//글리신 씨，//귀여운 면도 있네요～．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ふふ～ん、ホームシックですか？//グリシーヌさん、//かわいいところがあるですね～。", "pointer_offset": 364, "unit": "dialogue:bbda91f695edf0f4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 918, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f1ab8143f1abf1acf14481b82f2ff8b2f0b1f8e7f1adf2bcfa57f258f0b2f29c81b8", "baseline_text": "바，바보가∈//이 나를 우롱할 셈이냐∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "バ、バカもの！//この私を愚弄する気か∈", "pointer_offset": 368, "unit": "dialogue:6b0374ee197a6590", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 957, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f0a5f0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff0b2f27ef8f1f0c6f0f7f0a5f9c7f267f0ef8144", "baseline_text": "하지만…//이렇게 생각하면 돼요．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "でも……//こう考えるといいですよ。", "pointer_offset": 372, "unit": "dialogue:b73f90d1b0bbcde4", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 1520, "capacity": 86, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0dff0f4f0b9f947f0a6f17df1daf8c8f0a4f167f18481432f2ff0dff162f163f164f165f8e1f1ccf194f0a2f0a3f947f158f36df0a5f1572f2ff28a81432f2ff253f8e7f192f0e4f0bcfc83f5b7f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "이 제도에서 사람들을 지키고，//제국화격단의 일원으로서 노력하는//건，//저를 성장시켜 줍니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この帝都で、人々を守り、//帝撃の一員としてがんばるのは、//自分を成長させてくれます。", "pointer_offset": 376, "unit": "dialogue:c39a36aa90e2c7aa", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 1368, "capacity": 86, "raw_hex": "f19cf944f192f0e4f1a9f0cff1c78143f144f146f8e1f0b2f3def0c82f2ff0a4f167f957f299f8f4f144f1e8fa57f1c8f26bf0ef81442f2ff1ccf0a1f0b2f14ef8b4f1abf8a3f0b2fa62f299f0b2f3b6f0b8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "내가 성장한다면，가문의 이름을//지키는 것도 가능할 거예요．//일석이조란 바로 이런 것이랍니다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "自分が成長すれば、//家名を守ることもできるはず。//一石二鳥とはこのことで～す！", "pointer_offset": 380, "unit": "dialogue:69cfe6204e2ce27f", "prior_review": "재검수2"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 1455, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0d8f0e2f0b9f8f1f35ff9c6f285f0b2f14881432f2ff59cf0b9f8f4f0c6f0f7f8a4f281f0ccf0a4f1d4f7d12f2ff24cf24df8b6f1ccf0aef944f154f0a98144", "baseline_text": "그대에게 배울 줄이야，//꿈에도 생각지 못했지만…//확실히 일리가 있군．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そなたに教えられるとは、//心底思わなかったが……//確かに、一理あるな。", "pointer_offset": 384, "unit": "dialogue:27259c343a7dcd96", "prior_review": "재검수2"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 1227, "capacity": 68, "raw_hex": "faccf24df2cbf243f957f263f2d6f149f0b8f0cff1d4f7d12f2ff25c8143f0d8fa62f2d1f0b2f0b8f261f0ef2f2ff1ccf965f36bf36cf8b6f94bf366f0f1f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "꽤 실례되는 말투입니다만…//뭐，그런 법이니까요//일단 열심히 해 볼게요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "かなり失礼な言い方ですけど……//ま、そういうことですから//とりあえずがんばるでーす∈", "pointer_offset": 388, "unit": "dialogue:b8f6caaa7495ac40", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 1312, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f1cff0cf81b82f2ff271fac0f299f8f3f8b2f1bdf25ef0b22f2ff3a1f9aef0cff2c3f8e1f1ccf0b2f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "좋다∈//모든 것은 이 싸움이//끝난 다음의 일이다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よかろう！//すべてはこの戦いが//終わってからだな∈", "pointer_offset": 392, "unit": "dialogue:6e79a7b2c8aefc95", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04032.SBN", "offset": 1363, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 396, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
